                    607.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Employees who are separated from the service by a discharge under other than honorable conditions, bad conduct, or dishonorable discharge shall not be entitled to any of the benefits of Section 3 through Section 9 of the Article (relating to military leaves without pay) except such vested rights as they may have acquired thereto by virtue of payments made into their retirement accounts.",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                633,
